uote":"播弟充及息崧","reading":"原句具「息崧」，切勿只據後置詞補其直接父親。","note":"原句具「息崧」，切勿只據後置詞補其直接父親。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang:p002","start_codepoint":248,"end_codepoint":254,"human_reviewed":false,"related_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAACC","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang-ws2650517"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang:p002:m0253","surface":"崧","start":253,"end":254,"person_id":"h2b_sae_yse","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang:p002","text":"元帝承制，更拜撫軍大將軍、開府，給千兵百騎，詔與南頓王宗統流人以實中州，江西荒梗，復還。及元帝踐阼，進位侍中、太保。以羕屬尊，元會特為設床。太興初，錄尚書事，尋領大宗師，加羽葆、斧鉞，班劍六十人，進位太宰。及王敦平，領太尉。明帝即位，以羕宗室元老，特為之拜。羕放縱兵士劫鈔，所司奏免羕官，詔不問。及帝寢疾，羕與王導同受顧命輔成帝。時帝幼沖，詔羕依安平獻王孚故事，設床帳於殿上，帝親迎拜。咸和初，坐弟南頓王宗免官，降為弋陽縣王。及蘇峻作亂，羕詣峻稱述其勳，峻大悅，矯詔復羕爵位。峻平，賜死。世子播、播弟充及息崧並伏誅，國除。咸康初，復其屬籍，以羕孫瑉為奉車都尉、奉朝請。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":41,"last_line":41,"raw_start":3144,"raw_end":3430,"raw_character_offsets":[3146,3147,3148,3149,3150,3151,3152,3153,3154,3155,3156,3157,3158,3159,3160,3161,3162,3163,3164,3165,3166,3167,3168,3169,3170,3171,3172,3173,3174,3175,3176,3177,3178,3179,3180,3181,3182,3183,3184,3185,3186,3187,3188,3189,3190,3191,3192,3193,3194,3195,3196,3197,3198,3199,3200,3201,3202,3203,3204,3205,3206,3207,3208,3209,3210,3211,3212,3213,3214,3215,3216,3217,3218,3219,3220,3221,3222,3223,3224,3225,3226